  "description": "A stranger tells me I'm his girlfriend!  \n***  \nJake was rescued by the dream demon Bei before he died, and the two agreed to be together in the next life. However, the death of the dream demon dealt a huge blow to him. Just when he was at a loss, he actually met girl who looked like Bell in this world. Is this a coincidence, or is it destined?\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=3639154)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=3998868), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61877679), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/grace2dev), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/grace_devil), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059889)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/bless-the-devil/list?title_no=1582), [S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/FANTASY/emodeyinxing/list?title_no=1407), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0001351)",
